{
  "info": {
    "name": "dossiq package: besluitvorming",
    "description": "Reads every kind of row the besluitvorming package writes back through the OpenRegister objects API, after the packages workflow installed it on a clean instance (hydra ADR-118). Ids are the fixed ids in lib/Settings/packages/besluitvorming/. Written by scripts/packages/package-to-newman.py.",
